ique rewiring gameplay mechanic with fast gunplay and power-ups, to take down enemies and reach your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/Kill_Enemies_Title_B.gif?t=1749160236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High-Octane 'Hacktion' -\u00a0</strong>Wire's skills go beyond their leet hacking abilities, they're also deadly with an arsenal of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/Shootout_Action_D.gif?t=1749160236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Side-objectives &amp; Time Trials -\u00a0</strong>Overcome missions in various creative ways to complete different side-objectives, and beat time trials to collect trophies along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/Soundtrack_Title_B.gif?t=1749160236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic Synthwave Soundtrack -\u00a0</strong>Lose yourself in <strong>DeadWire's</strong> immersive cyberpunk soundscape that evokes a future world of dystopian technology and burgeoning rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/Shooting_Action_A.gif?t=1749160236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Become the ultimate operator -\u00a0</strong>Unravel <strong>DeadWire's</strong> tale of dark web deceit and treachery in a neon-soaked dystopian city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/Wishlist_and_Follow_Title_B.gif?t=1749160236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist and join the Discord; keep up to date with the <strong>Deadwire</strong> experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/Shootout_Action_B.gif?t=1749160236\" /></p>","developers":["Shotgun Anaconda"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/header.jpg?t=1749160236","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098059,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098059/movie480.mp4?t=1739450162","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098059/movie_max.mp4?t=1739450162"},"name":"Wishlist trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098059/3cefa6de48de7ffe390d17040767c23f487156ba/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739450162","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098059/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739450162","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098059/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739450162"}}],"name":"DeadWire","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2125, AMD Phenom II X4 960 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 MB VRAM, Radeon Vega 7/GTX 1030/Intel Iris 550 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3 3300X or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB VRAM, RX 460/GTX 1050/Iris Xe DG1 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["The CoLab"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas il\u00edcitas\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nAtos criminosos","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogen\nDerbe Sprache\nFantasy-Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q3 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThere are plenty of cyberpunk games which allow you to use hacking in combat, but few with such immediate, explosive consequences\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cIt feels absolutely badass to use your hacking powers in varied violent ways, and I\u2019m looking forward to causing a lot of damage with them. When I think of hacking in games I think of puzzle mini games, but Deadwire\u2019s hacking focus is so much more than this\u201d<br>Loot Level Chill<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/960c26c9720be989550ed148f8e4e48d441938f6/ss_960c26c9720be989550ed148f8e4e48d441938f6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749160236","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/960c26c9720be989550ed148f8e4e48d441938f6/ss_960c26c9720be989550ed148f8e4e48d441938f6.600x338.jpg?t=1749160236"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/c1a02eec6002417945fe3c5186fe712ec63d38c5/ss_c1a02eec6002417945fe3c5186fe712ec63d38c5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749160236","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/c1a02eec6002417945fe3c5186fe712ec63d38c5/ss_c1a02eec6002417945fe3c5186fe712ec63d38c5.600x338.jpg?t=1749160236"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/ss_2bf81bd3f6d3148e